#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0216 expect=skipped domain=SV
#note "SV deliberately carries no VISITDY column. Requirements.Variables.All is [SVUPDES, VISITDY] and the absent VISITDY skips the whole rule even though SVUPDES is present and populated; VISITDY is Perm in SV, so an SV dataset without it is fully conformant."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-3
dataset SV label="Subject Visits"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col VISITNUM type=Num  label="Visit Number"
col VISIT    type=Char label="Visit Name"
col SVUPDES  type=Char label="Description of Unplanned Visit"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | SV | 01-701-1015 | 1.1 | UNSCHEDULED | Subject felt unwell
